# termos
===
 Desktop SSH client for sysadmins: store hosts, keys, and passwords in one encrypted vault, open SSH/Telnet/Serial terminals, transfer files via SFTP, configure port forwarding, and manage Proxmox VMs/containers from a single application. Sync across devices and share with your team via your own server.
